:: OC Manuel English Class Bathroom [nobr]

<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Hart</span> has you all reading silently, finishing up the next few chapters in preparation for a test. As you are reading, <span style="color:yellow">you suddenly feel the urge to use the bathroom</span> and walk up to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Hart</span>'s desk to ask for permission to go. He gives you the bathroom pass and you are sent on your way.<br>
<br>

